flowchart TB
  A[User action on finance screen] --> B[fetch call to finance endpoint]
  B --> C[Service worker intercept]
  C --> D[Finance request handler]
  D --> E{Role and creator checks}
  E -- HTTP 403 --> F[UI hides control and shows refusal]
  E -- passes --> G{Balance, status and reason rules}
  G -- HTTP 422 --> F
  G -- valid --> H[Entry record written]
  H --> I[History row appended]
  I --> J[(IndexedDB ledger)]
  J --> K[JSON response to approvals queue and entry page]